    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "textbook-minimal-source",
        "moduleId": "source-and-artifacts",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材中的第一个程序",
        "markdown": "教材把第一个程序写进 `5-basic.s`，全文只有段声明、符号导出、对齐指令和两条指令：\n\n```armasm\n# 5-basic.s\n    .section    __TEXT,__text\n    .globl  _main\n    .p2align    2\n_main:\n    mov    w0, #0\n    ret\n```\n\n这份 `.s` 文件是纯文本源码，机器不能直接执行它；它只是后续两步命令的输入。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000029"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第一个汇编程序",
                "第一个程序"
              ],
              "lineStart": 590,
              "lineEnd": 625,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "31c8074eace762386fe39e5cb31dc21ebe8dd8c7be6375d781a70c0f1a276d44"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-section-boundary",
        "moduleId": "source-and-artifacts",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "本节先走通流程",
        "markdown": "教材明确说明：关于这个程序本身的解释留到下一篇文章，本节接下来的篇幅先聚焦汇编器与汇编语法。因此本节的目标是“把程序建出来”而不是逐行解释指令。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
